parameters.help_en:
The list of features. Note the following configuration limits:
The product of "Number of domain names" multiplied by "Number of Functions" must be less than or equal to 20. For example:
If the number of Functions configured at a time is 20, you can specify only 1 domain name at a time.
If the number of Functions configured at a time is 1, you can specify up to 20 domain names at a time.

The format is as follows:
functionName (feature name): For configurable features, see https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/410622.html. Separate multiple parameters with commas (,).
argName: The configuration item of functionName. You can configure multiple configuration items.
argValue: The value of the configuration item of functionName.
parentid (rule condition ID, optional): By configuring the condition feature function (rule engine) in https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/410622.html, you can create rule conditions. Rule conditions can match and filter user requests by identifying various parameters carried in user requests. After each rule condition is created, a corresponding https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/388994.html is generated. The configid can be used as the ParentId parameter and referenced by other feature functions. This way, rule conditions can be combined with feature configurations to form more flexible configurations.

```
[
 {
   "functionArgs": [
    {
     "argName": "Feature parameter A", 
     "argValue": "Value of feature parameter A"
    }, 
  {
    "argName": "Feature parameter B", 
    "argValue": "Value of feature parameter B"
     }
 ], 
 "functionName": "Feature name"
    }
]
```

parameters.help_zh:
功能列表。注意以下配置限制：
“域名数量” 乘以 “Functions 数量” 的值小于等于 20。例如：
如果单次配置的Functions 数量为20，那么单次只能传1个域名。
如果单次配置的Functions 数量为1，那么单次可以传20个域名。

格式如下：
functionName（功能名称）：可配置功能请参见https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/410622.html，多个参数之间用半角逗号（,）分隔。
argName：functionName的配置项（可配置多个配置项）。
argValue：functionName的配置项的取值。
parentid（规则条件ID，非必填）：通过配置https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/410622.html中的功能函数**condition**（规则引擎），可以创建出规则条件（规则条件可以通过识别用户请求中携带的各种参数来匹配和过滤用户请求），每一个规则条件被创建以后都会生成一个对应的https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/388994.html，configid可以被当作ParentId参数被其他功能函数引用，这样规则条件就可以与功能配置一起组合形成更灵活的配置。

```
[
 {
   "functionArgs": [
    {
     "argName": "功能参数A", 
     "argValue": "功能参数A对应的值"
    }, 
  {
    "argName": "功能参数B", 
    "argValue": "功能参数B对应的值"
     }
 ], 
 "functionName": "功能名称"
    }
]
```
